{"4733460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moto Trial Turbo", "steam_appid": 4733460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speed, Balance, and One Perfect Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moto Trial Turbo</strong> is an arcade-style <strong>2D motorcycle trials game</strong> where bike physics, precise controls, and intense tracks turn every run into a battle for seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the throttle, keep your balance, use turbo at the perfect moment, and complete each level cleaner, faster, and bolder than before. It’s not just about reaching the finish line — it’s about feeling the bike: knowing when to take a risk, when to slow down, when to lift the front wheel, and when to carefully survive the next section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/4175be45bbb479e3812d62a6ada6f1ea.poster.avif?t=1786814246\" width=690 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/4175be45bbb479e3812d62a6ada6f1ea.webm?t=1786814246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/4175be45bbb479e3812d62a6ada6f1ea.mp4?t=1786814246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Moto Trial Turbo Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging but exciting tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the best levels created by the community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost replay of your own run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global player leaderboard for every track</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible stars — sometimes hidden</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/10132285f2eac030611de3338c1b78e1.poster.avif?t=1786814246\" width=692 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/10132285f2eac030611de3338c1b78e1.webm?t=1786814246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/10132285f2eac030611de3338c1b78e1.mp4?t=1786814246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete for the Best Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Moto Trial Turbo</strong>, the finish line is not the end of the level — it’s the beginning of your next attempt. Online leaderboards let you compare your results with players around the world and return to completed tracks to sharpen your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Own Tracks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the standard challenges are no longer enough, open the level editor and build your own runs: short high-speed tracks, technical routes with jumps, or difficult obstacle courses with traps, portals, gravity, and moving platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place terrain, objects, checkpoints, traps, collectible stars, and special elements, instantly test your level in playtest mode, and fine-tune the track until it has the right rhythm — fair, challenging, or even completely insane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/a1ab9822e56a7f36445eb098f596d991.poster.avif?t=1786814246\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/a1ab9822e56a7f36445eb098f596d991.webm?t=1786814246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/a1ab9822e56a7f36445eb098f596d991.mp4?t=1786814246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Community Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moto Trial Turbo</strong> doesn’t end with the built-in tracks. Play levels created by other players! Some players build challenges, others try to beat them, and others turn them into races for the best time. This makes the game an almost endless playground for new runs.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speed, Balance, and One Perfect Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moto Trial Turbo</strong> is an arcade-style <strong>2D motorcycle trials game</strong> where bike physics, precise controls, and intense tracks turn every run into a battle for seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the throttle, keep your balance, use turbo at the perfect moment, and complete each level cleaner, faster, and bolder than before. It’s not just about reaching the finish line — it’s about feeling the bike: knowing when to take a risk, when to slow down, when to lift the front wheel, and when to carefully survive the next section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/4175be45bbb479e3812d62a6ada6f1ea.poster.avif?t=1786814246\" width=690 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/4175be45bbb479e3812d62a6ada6f1ea.webm?t=1786814246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/4175be45bbb479e3812d62a6ada6f1ea.mp4?t=1786814246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Moto Trial Turbo Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging but exciting tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the best levels created by the community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost replay of your own run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global player leaderboard for every track</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible stars — sometimes hidden</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/10132285f2eac030611de3338c1b78e1.poster.avif?t=1786814246\" width=692 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/10132285f2eac030611de3338c1b78e1.webm?t=1786814246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/10132285f2eac030611de3338c1b78e1.mp4?t=1786814246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete for the Best Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Moto Trial Turbo</strong>, the finish line is not the end of the level — it’s the beginning of your next attempt. Online leaderboards let you compare your results with players around the world and return to completed tracks to sharpen your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Own Tracks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the standard challenges are no longer enough, open the level editor and build your own runs: short high-speed tracks, technical routes with jumps, or difficult obstacle courses with traps, portals, gravity, and moving platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place terrain, objects, checkpoints, traps, collectible stars, and special elements, instantly test your level in playtest mode, and fine-tune the track until it has the right rhythm — fair, challenging, or even completely insane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/a1ab9822e56a7f36445eb098f596d991.poster.avif?t=1786814246\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/a1ab9822e56a7f36445eb098f596d991.webm?t=1786814246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/extras/a1ab9822e56a7f36445eb098f596d991.mp4?t=1786814246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Community Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moto Trial Turbo</strong> doesn’t end with the built-in tracks. Play levels created by other players! Some players build challenges, others try to beat them, and others turn them into races for the best time. This makes the game an almost endless playground for new runs.</p>", "short_description": "Moto Trial Turbo is a physics-based 2D arcade motorcycle trial game. Players can look forward to exciting tracks, devious traps, secrets, and even player-created levels! Complete challenging tracks against the clock and compete with players from around the world on the leaderboards.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Ukrainian, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733460/afc49f03065cc245cbad21fe579895c9c194ef37/header.jpg?t=1786814246", "capsule_image":